# monochrome-43.roles - which Monochrome 43 colour fills each role.
#
# Black, white and greys; colour only where it means something: the one
# blue for focus and links, red for errors, the urgent pink for warnings.
# Strings, keywords and git noise stay grey. Format: role|colour name in
# monochrome-43.conf.

bg|bg
bg-dark|bg
surface|surface
fg|fg-soft
comment|fg-dark
blue|highlight
cyan|fg-muted
green|fg-dim
yellow|urgent
magenta|fg
vermilion|danger
terracotta|urgent
ultramarine|surface
viridian|bg-track
diff-add|bg-track
diff-del|surface
